/**
 * Grade-receipt contract (§7 pure-derivation port, CRVa-M2): the modal
 * behind the hero's grade circle mirrors the engine's dock math from the
 * published rows, reconciles every derived number against the published
 * grade block, and degrades to bucket-level (verified:false, no per-item
 * points) on any mismatch. Every fixture's grade block was generated by
 * the REAL engine (cf_lib.facility_grade) from these exact inspection docs
 * — engine-certified, not hand-trusted. Ported from
 * tests/grade-receipt.test.mjs (its behavioral half; the old design's
 * source/CSS wiring scans are superseded by the CRV component suites).
 */
